WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.530
- But your family is from Jamaica.

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:02.430
- Yes.
- I love Jamaica.

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:03.450
So I heard while you were there-

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.283
- Love Jamaica.

00:00:04.283 --> 00:00:05.188
Who loves Jamaica?

00:00:05.188 --> 00:00:06.021
- Who doesn't love Jamaica?

00:00:06.021 --> 00:00:07.290
(audience cheering)

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:09.487
It's like one of those places
you go and you're like,

00:00:09.487 --> 00:00:11.640
"People live here."

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:12.570
When we go on vacation,

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:15.270
it's like, this is when
you start questioning

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:17.160
your life decisions and
why you aren't living

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.030
in a certain place.

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.230
But it's beautiful there.

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:20.130
But I heard that you ran into

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:21.720
the legendary Grace Jones there.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:22.650
- Oh my God, yes.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:23.670
- That's incredible.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:27.390
First of all, just you
two in the same room.

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:29.130
I don't know if there's enough,

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:31.740
that's a lot of powerful energy happening.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:32.910
- First of all, I love Grace Jones.

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:33.810
I'm obsessed with her.

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:34.643
- [Kelly] Who doesn't?

00:00:34.643 --> 00:00:36.450
- She's incredible and then secondly,

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:38.040
so Grace Jones is from Spanish Town

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:39.240
which is where my mother's from.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.490
So I'm convinced that we're related

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:43.800
and when I met Grace, she was
like, "We could be sisters."

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:46.140
And I'm like, "Oh, Grace."

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:47.730
- I agree.
- You see it too, Grace?

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:49.080
- [Kelly] You see it too.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:50.700
I heard that, did y'all end up dancing?

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:52.740
- Yes, we danced love all night together

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:54.870
because she's a partier.

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:55.703
I love her.

00:00:55.703 --> 00:00:57.390
She loves to dance and I love to dance

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.017
and I was like, "Oh my God,

00:00:59.017 --> 00:01:01.410
"I want to dance floor with Grace Jones."

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:03.393
- That's a win in life.

